                <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--primary-color); font-weight: bold;">🌧️ 淡季</span>
                <h3 style="font-size: 2rem; margin: 10px 0; color: var(--text-dark);">雨季</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #555; margin-bottom: 20px;">郁郁葱葱，绿意盎然，充满魔力。游客更少，价格更低，赛库普等瀑布水势最为壮观。雨通常只持续几个小时。</p>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <span style="background: var(--primary-color); color: #fff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: bold;">十一月 - 三月</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; max-width: 1020px; margin: 40px auto 0; padding: 0 50px;">
            <div style="padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-passport" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                <h4 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">落地签证</h4>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;">大多数国籍的游客可在机场办理 30 天落地签证，或提前在线申请。</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-plug" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                <h4 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">电源插座</h4>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;">巴厘岛使用欧式 C 型和 F 型双脚插座（230V）。</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-hands-praying" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                <h4 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">尊重文化</h4>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;">进入寺庙需遮盖肩膀和膝盖。通常需要并会提供纱笼。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="testimonials" id="reviews">
        <h2 class="section-title reveal">游客怎么说</h2>
        <div class="testimonials-container">
            <div class="testimonial-card reveal delay-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left quote-icon"></i>
                <div>
                    <div class="stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></div>
                    <p class="review-text">"绝对难忘的体验！团队为我们安排好了一切，从快艇到浮潜装备。与魔鬼鱼一起游泳是梦想成真。"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="reviewer"><h4>Sarah Jenkins</h4><span>澳大利亚</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-card reveal delay-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left quote-icon"></i>
                <div>
                    <div class="stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></div>
                    <p class="review-text">"我们的家庭旅行完美无瑕。司机非常友好，在大批人群到来之前就知道凯灵金海滩所有最佳的拍照地点。强烈推荐！"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="reviewer"><h4>Budi Santoso</h4><span>印度尼西亚雅加达</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-card reveal delay-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left quote-icon"></i>
                <div>
                    <div class="stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star-half-stroke"></i></div>
                    <p class="review-text">"非常专业的旅行社。通过 WhatsApp 的沟通即时高效，东佩尼达岛之旅令人叹为观止。物超所值！"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="reviewer"><h4>Liam O'Connor</h4><span>英国</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="booking-section" id="book-now">
        <h2 class="section-title">预订您的冒险之旅</h2>
        <div class="booking-container reveal">
            <form class="booking-form" name="booking" action="/" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
                <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="booking">
                <p style="display:none;"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="name">全名</label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="请输入您的全名" autocomplete="name" autocapitalize="words" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="whatsapp">WhatsApp 号码</label>
                        <input type="tel" id="whatsapp" name="whatsapp" placeholder="+62..." autocomplete="tel" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="package">选择旅游套餐</label>
                        <select id="package" name="package" required>
                            <option value="" disabled selected>选择行程...</option>
                            <option value="West Nusa Penida">西佩尼达岛之旅</option>
                            <option value="East Nusa Penida">东佩尼达岛之旅</option>
                            <option value="Nusa Penida Snorkeling">佩尼达岛浮潜</option>
                            <option value="Uluwatu Full Day">乌鲁瓦图全日游</option>
                            <option value="Sekumpul Waterfall">赛库普瀑布之旅</option>
                            <option value="North Bali Canyoning">北巴厘岛峡谷探险</option>
                            <option value="Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking">巴图尔火山日出徒步</option>
                            <option value="Private Transport (Custom Tour)">私人包车（定制游）</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="date">旅行日期</label>
                        <input type="date" id="date" name="date" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="pax">人数</label>
                        <input type="number" id="pax" name="pax" min="1" placeholder="多少人？" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="message">特殊要求 / 备注</label>
                    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="有任何饮食要求或特定接送地点吗？" autocapitalize="sentences"></textarea>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn submit-btn">提交预订请求</button>
                <div id="booking-confirmation" style="display:none; margin-top:16px; padding:14px 18px; background:#e8f5e9; border:1px solid #4CAF50; border-radius:8px; color:#2e7d32; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.5;"></div>
                <div class="payment-trust-badge" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
                    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;">提交后，我们将通过 WhatsApp 确认空位并发送付款方式 — 国际卡可用安全的 PayPal 链接，本地客人可用银行转账。</p>
                    <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px;">
                        <i class="fa-brands fa-cc-paypal" title="PayPal" style="color: #00457c; transition: transform 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'"></i>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns" title="Bank Transfer" style="color: #4CAF50; transition: transform 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.1)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>
{% endraw %}{% endblock %}
